1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,580
In our home, every story begins with coffee.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,820
When my grandmother was young, she roasted coffee over the fire in her village.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,340
The smell of coffee called all the neighbours. This is abol, the first cup.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,460
Then her children came. They grew up around the same jebena.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:34,900
Tona, the second cup, was a time of laughter and stories.

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:42,100
One day her children went far away. The house fell silent.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,820
But she never stopped making coffee.

8
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,420
Today her grandchildren join her by phone.

9
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:03,660
Bereka, the third cup, is the cup of blessing.

10
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:11,500
Even when we are far away, her cup is always waiting for us.
